                            <h2 class="title" id="overview_heading">Overview</h2>
                            <h2>Seamless Sales: Process Transformation for a Fortune 500 Company</h2>
<p><span data-sheets-value="{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;A momentous digital and process transformation was underway at HP, but the message wasn\u2019t effectively getting out across the org.\n\nHP needed a powerful story to unify their collective efforts globally. That\u2019s what we delivered with Seamless Sales. This new vision connected once distant internal teams and made for happier customers and partners. That\u2019s a win\u2014win\u2014win.&quot;}" data-sheets-userformat="{&quot;2&quot;:897,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0}">Hewlett-Packard needed help telling a story. The Fortune 500 company had been pouring time, energy, and resources into a digital and process transformation effort that would have a huge impact on the way sales were managed at the company. Unfortunately, the message wasn’t effectively getting out across the organization.</span></p>
<p>HP needed a powerful story to unify their collective efforts around the world. We helped the company communicate its vision to all stakeholders—creating a seamless sales process that connected once-distant internal teams, leading to happier customers and partners.</p>
                        
                        

                        


                        


                        


                        

                        
                        
